flowchart LR
    subgraph ingest [1. Ingest]
        direction TB
        F[Course file<br/>PDF, PPTX or DOCX] --> B[Baseline parser<br/>text, tables, notes]
        B -- "flagged pages:<br/>large images,<br/>vector drawings" --> V[Claude vision<br/>formulas, diagrams<br/>cached per page]
        B --> D[Document<br/>citable pages → blocks]
        V --> D
    end

    subgraph generate [2. Generate and check]
        direction TB
        T[Topic map<br/>one call per document] --> G[Generate questions<br/>schema-validated JSON,<br/>each cites a page<br/>+ exact quote]
        G --> C[Code checks<br/>quote on cited page,<br/>4 distinct options,<br/>known topics,<br/>no duplicates]
        C --> P[Passed]
        C --> R[Rejected,<br/>with reasons]
    end

    ingest --> generate
